subgraph SUP["1. Campaign supervision"]
    START["Start or resume the existing campaign"]:::process
    LOCK["Acquire nonblocking supervisor lock<br/>One owner per user home"]:::process
    LOAD["Validate saved identity, configuration and run manifest<br/>Keep original start and cutoff<br/>Default duration: 12 hours; configurable"]:::evidence
    RECOVER_OWNER["Check saved PID identity before recovery<br/>Reap owned orphan group; close interrupted repair<br/>Replay audit outbox; retain original incident"]:::process
    SUP_REJECT["Reject unsafe startup<br/>Do not claim another owner's process<br/>Preserve existing campaign evidence"]:::stop
    SUP_BLOCKED{"Persisted blocked phase<br/>or repair-account quota block?"}:::decision
    SUP_HOLD["Exit 2 with campaign state preserved<br/>Existing owner requires explicit reconciliation<br/>Restart alone does not clear the blocker"]:::stop
    DEADLINE{"Original cutoff reached<br/>or stop requested?"}:::decision
    STOP["Stop and reap owned child processes<br/>Preserve world, checkpoint and original cutoff"]:::stop
    REPAIR_REQUIRED{"Unresolved repair incident?"}:::decision
    SUP_CHECKPOINT{"Checkpoint status?"}:::decision
    SOURCE_GUARD{"Pending action and source revision<br/>missing or changed?"}:::decision
    SOURCE_AMBIGUITY["Capture reconciliation incident<br/>Do not launch gameplay against changed source"]:::caution
    SUP_AUDIT["Record source revision and segment<br/>Durably persist child-launch audit transition<br/>Audit failure stops further launches"]:::evidence
    LAUNCH["Resume FLE hierarchical controller<br/>Same checkpoint and session; remaining time only<br/>Hybrid policy; Jev 1.13.0; configured features"]:::process
    WATCH["Monitor checkpoint, owned process and fresh health<br/>Default polling interval: 5 seconds"]:::process
    HEALTH{"Controller state?"}:::decision
    HEALTH_HOLD{"Fresh matching health shows provider,<br/>storage or maintenance hold,<br/>or an owned pending/background job?"}:::decision
    HEALTH_WAIT["Refresh watchdog baseline<br/>Keep observing without invoking source repair<br/>A heartbeat alone is not useful progress"]:::caution
    HEARTBEAT{"Checkpoint unchanged beyond hang threshold?<br/>Default: 600 seconds"}:::decision
    SUCCESS["Controller checkpoint reports completed<br/>Stop owned gameplay process<br/>Supervisor records campaign completion"]:::success
    SUP_WATCH_TIME{"Time remains and no stop request?"}:::decision

    START --> LOCK
    LOCK -->|Owned| LOAD
    LOCK -->|Already locked| SUP_REJECT
    LOAD -->|Valid| RECOVER_OWNER
    LOAD -->|Identity or configuration mismatch| SUP_REJECT
    RECOVER_OWNER -->|Recovered| SUP_BLOCKED
    RECOVER_OWNER -->|Reused PID or unusable checkpoint| SUP_REJECT
    SUP_BLOCKED -->|Yes| SUP_HOLD
    SUP_BLOCKED -->|No| DEADLINE
    DEADLINE -->|Yes| STOP
    DEADLINE -->|No| REPAIR_REQUIRED
    REPAIR_REQUIRED -->|Yes| INCIDENT
    REPAIR_REQUIRED -->|No| SUP_CHECKPOINT
    SUP_CHECKPOINT -->|Completed| SUCCESS
    SUP_CHECKPOINT -->|Blocked, uncertain or invalid| INCIDENT
    SUP_CHECKPOINT -->|Running| SOURCE_GUARD
    SOURCE_GUARD -->|Yes| SOURCE_AMBIGUITY --> INCIDENT
    SOURCE_GUARD -->|No| SUP_AUDIT
    SUP_AUDIT -->|Durable and time remains| LAUNCH
    SUP_AUDIT -->|Audit failure, stop or cutoff| STOP
    LAUNCH --> WATCH --> HEALTH
    HEALTH -->|Running| HEALTH_HOLD
    HEALTH_HOLD -->|Yes| HEALTH_WAIT --> SUP_WATCH_TIME
    HEALTH_HOLD -->|No| HEARTBEAT
    HEARTBEAT -->|No| SUP_WATCH_TIME
    HEARTBEAT -->|Yes| INCIDENT
    HEALTH -->|Completed| SUCCESS
    HEALTH -->|Blocked, uncertain, exited or invalid| INCIDENT
    SUP_WATCH_TIME -->|Yes| WATCH
    SUP_WATCH_TIME -->|No| STOP
end

subgraph CTRL["2. Hierarchical controller"]
    OBS["Observe backend and enabled capabilities<br/>Native entities, receipts, research,<br/>owned routes, jobs and launch evidence"]:::evidence
    VALID{"Session, finite facts and monotonic tick valid?<br/>Enabled capabilities match retained ownership?"}:::decision
    PENDING{"Running or uncertain controller<br/>has an unresolved pending action?"}:::decision
    TERMINAL{"Completed, blocked or uncertain?"}:::decision
    ADMISSION{"Maintenance and storage<br/>admit new work?"}:::decision
    GOALS["Check prerequisite-ordered native predicates<br/>Retain previously verified milestones<br/>Defer goal changes during tracked background craft"]:::process
    TARGET_DONE{"Target milestone verified?"}:::decision
    COMPLETE_RECORD["Persist completed checkpoint<br/>Record verified completion and publish status"]:::evidence
    ACTIVE{"Committed plan exists?"}:::decision
    COMPILE["Compile the effective capability-aware frontier<br/>Bootstrap, serial or ready-work planner<br/>Then apply committed-capital constraints"]:::process
    FILTER["Apply two-failure plan budget<br/>Include connection failure attribution"]:::process
    CANDIDATES{"Eligible plans remain?"}:::decision
    BLOCKED["Mark blocked<br/>Retain exact reason and failure history"]:::stop
    RANK["Ready-work: deduplicate and rank<br/>Urgency, immediate need, estimated actor cost<br/>Heuristics do not authorize execution"]:::process
    POLICY{"Selection policy?"}:::decision
    DETERMINISTIC["Choose ready-work ranking first<br/>Otherwise step count, then plan ID"]:::process
    COMMIT["Commit selected plan and step index<br/>Persist any capital or successor intent"]:::process
    FRESH["Observe again before dispatch<br/>Recheck capability, maintenance and storage barriers"]:::evidence
    BARRIER{"Safe to execute now?"}:::decision
    SKIP["Skip steps with observed postconditions"]:::process
    PLAN_DONE{"All plan effects already satisfied?"}:::decision
    PRECONDITION{"Next step allowed by native state,<br/>ownership, locks and capital budget?"}:::decision
    RESERVE{"Required carried materials available<br/>for reservation?"}:::decision
    WRITEAHEAD["Persist pending = prepared BEFORE dispatch<br/>Attempt identity, receipt, start tick and polls"]:::process
    DISPATCH["Execute one committed step<br/>One dispatcher; no concurrent game mutations"]:::process
    DISPATCH_ERROR{"Which exception contract?"}:::decision
    LOCAL_HOLD["Proven local maintenance or storage rejection<br/>Record rejected attempt; clear pending<br/>Retain plan and reservations"]:::caution
    AMBIGUOUS["Persist ambiguous dispatch and error<br/>Retain pending for reconciliation<br/>Never blindly replay"]:::caution
    RETURN_STATE["Persist dispatch = returned"]:::process
    AFTER["Observe after dispatch<br/>Apply the composed execution barrier"]:::evidence
    EFFECT{"Native postcondition satisfied?"}:::decision
    BG_ADMIT{"Background mode: accepted craft receipt<br/>and paid-input evidence permit admission?"}:::decision
    BG_TRACK["Persist job and original attempt<br/>Lock future outputs; release paid-input reservation<br/>Independent actions remain serial"]:::process
    VERIFIED["Record verified attempt; release reservation<br/>Clear pending, advance step<br/>Reset stalled-decision count"]:::success
    REMAINING{"More committed steps?"}:::decision
    CLEAR["Clear completed plan<br/>Refresh goal predicates when no background job"]:::process
    FAILPLAN["Increment plan failure count<br/>Release reservation and clear plan<br/>Retain failures and paid construction"]:::caution
    RECORD["Save checkpoint; append configured logs<br/>Publish truthful status, decisions and evidence"]:::evidence
    CADENCE["Wait configured interval within deadline<br/>Ready-work acknowledged research waits may back off<br/>No fixed deployed interval is assumed"]:::process
    GAME_ERROR["Unhandled controller, persistence<br/>or backend failure"]:::stop

    LAUNCH --> OBS --> VALID
    VALID -->|No| GAME_ERROR
    VALID -->|Yes| PENDING
    PENDING -->|Yes| VERIFY_PENDING
    PENDING -->|No| TERMINAL
    TERMINAL -->|Yes| RECORD
    TERMINAL -->|No| ADMISSION
    ADMISSION -->|Held| RECORD
    ADMISSION -->|Admitted| GOALS --> TARGET_DONE
    TARGET_DONE -->|Yes| COMPLETE_RECORD --> SUCCESS
    TARGET_DONE -->|No| ACTIVE
    ACTIVE -->|Yes| FRESH
    ACTIVE -->|No| COMPILE
    COMPILE --> FILTER --> CANDIDATES
    CANDIDATES -->|No| BLOCKED --> RECORD
    CANDIDATES -->|Yes| RANK --> POLICY
    POLICY -->|Deterministic, or healthy-provider hybrid with one ready-work choice| DETERMINISTIC
    POLICY -->|Jev or remaining hybrid cases| JEV_BATCH
    DETERMINISTIC --> COMMIT
    COMMIT --> FRESH --> BARRIER
    BARRIER -->|Held or fault| RECORD
    BARRIER -->|Yes| SKIP --> PLAN_DONE
    PLAN_DONE -->|Yes| CLEAR
    PLAN_DONE -->|No| PRECONDITION
    PRECONDITION -->|No| FAILPLAN
    PRECONDITION -->|Yes| RESERVE
    RESERVE -->|No| FAILPLAN
    RESERVE -->|Yes| WRITEAHEAD --> DISPATCH --> ACTION_TYPE
    NATIVE_ERROR --> DISPATCH_ERROR
    DISPATCH_ERROR -->|Local maintenance or storage guard proves no dispatch| LOCAL_HOLD --> RECORD
    DISPATCH_ERROR -->|Explicit connection preflight rejection| FAILPLAN
    DISPATCH_ERROR -->|Research recorder failed| GAME_ERROR
    DISPATCH_ERROR -->|Other error or lost acknowledgement| AMBIGUOUS --> RECORD
    NATIVE_RETURN --> RETURN_STATE --> AFTER
    AFTER -->|Capability fault| RECORD
    AFTER -->|Valid| EFFECT
    EFFECT -->|No| BG_ADMIT
    BG_ADMIT -->|Yes| BG_TRACK --> RECORD
    BG_TRACK -. retained craft observations .-> BG_WATCH
    BG_ADMIT -->|No| RECORD
    EFFECT -->|Yes| VERIFIED --> REMAINING
    REMAINING -->|Yes| RECORD
    REMAINING -->|No| CLEAR --> RECORD
    FAILPLAN --> RECORD
    RECORD --> CADENCE
    CADENCE -->|Running and budget remains| OBS
    CADENCE -->|Terminal or deadline| WATCH
    GAME_ERROR --> INCIDENT
end

subgraph GOAL_TREE["3. Goal dependencies and bootstrap skills"]
    FUEL_GOAL["stockpile_fuel prerequisite<br/>At least 5 carried coal"]:::evidence
    BOOT_GOAL["bootstrap_mining target or prerequisite<br/>Working burner drill, connected output<br/>and at least 5 collected iron ore"]:::evidence
    ROCKET_GOAL["rocket_launch target<br/>victory = true with exact source<br/>native:base-game-rocket-launch"]:::success
    IRON_GOAL["iron_smelting target<br/>At least 10 carried iron plates<br/>and native produced counter at least 10"]:::success
    STEAM_GOAL["steam_power target<br/>Lab energy above zero; nonzero network ID<br/>equal to the steam engine network ID"]:::success
    SCIENCE_GOAL["automation_science target<br/>At least 10 carried science packs<br/>and native produced counter at least 10"]:::success
    GOAL_RULE["Dependencies are code, not a model plan<br/>Record a milestone only after its prerequisites<br/>Previously verified milestones stay completed"]:::process
    BOOT_SELECT{"First incomplete bootstrap prerequisite?"}:::decision
    BOOT_COAL["Offer 5- or 10-coal inventory targets<br/>Walk to observed coal when needed<br/>Gather with five-unit backend macros"]:::process
    BOOT_BUILD["Require 5 coal, one carried drill and chest<br/>Walk to observed iron<br/>Place drill with connected output chest"]:::process
    BOOT_FUEL["Existing drill has no fuel<br/>Gather coal if below 5 carried<br/>Otherwise insert 5 coal"]:::process
    BOOT_OUTPUT["Fueled connected drill: idle until measured ore grows<br/>Factory-enabled path may first extract up to 50 ore<br/>from a full connected output chest"]:::process
    BOOT_BLOCK["Block on missing materials or observed resource,<br/>unverified output connection, or no feasible step"]:::stop
    BOOT_FEASIBLE["Skip satisfied steps and check next-step feasibility<br/>No full-game compiler without native factory support"]:::process

    GOALS -.-> GOAL_RULE --> FUEL_GOAL
    FUEL_GOAL --> BOOT_GOAL
    BOOT_GOAL --> ROCKET_GOAL
    BOOT_GOAL --> IRON_GOAL
    BOOT_GOAL --> STEAM_GOAL
    BOOT_GOAL --> SCIENCE_GOAL
    COMPILE -->|Fuel or bootstrap goal| BOOT_SELECT
    BOOT_SELECT -->|Coal prerequisite, or coal needed before construction| BOOT_COAL
    BOOT_SELECT -->|No drill; construction prerequisites available| BOOT_BUILD
    BOOT_SELECT -->|Connected drill has no fuel| BOOT_FUEL
    BOOT_SELECT -->|Fueled drill or full output| BOOT_OUTPUT
    BOOT_SELECT -->|Cannot safely proceed| BOOT_BLOCK
    BOOT_COAL --> BOOT_FEASIBLE
    BOOT_BUILD --> BOOT_FEASIBLE
    BOOT_FUEL --> BOOT_FEASIBLE
    BOOT_OUTPUT --> BOOT_FEASIBLE
    BOOT_FEASIBLE --> FILTER
    BOOT_BLOCK --> BLOCKED
end

subgraph FACTORY["4. Factory planning and optional production capabilities"]
    FP["Use the native recipe, technology<br/>and machine catalog"]:::evidence
    FP_MODE{"Factory scheduling option?"}:::decision
    SERIAL["serial: default<br/>One bounded prerequisite plan"]:::process
    READY_WORK["ready-work: opt-in<br/>Compile once with the effective planner<br/>Bound main lookahead to 32 items and 8 candidates by default"]:::process
    READY_LEDGER["Reuse supply and workload facts within this decision<br/>Consider research resupply and paid recurring producers<br/>Forecast output is not spendable inventory"]:::process
    READY_CAPS["Optional capability-aware planning<br/>Output buffers; input routes;<br/>background craft and research prefetch"]:::process
    READY_SITES["Optional rocket-goal additions<br/>Paid ore-side successors OR mining outposts<br/>Ownership, flow and reservation guards remain active"]:::process
    FP_READY{"Connected player and native<br/>factory telemetry available?"}:::decision
    FP_BIND{"Player bound to existing character?"}:::decision
    EMIT_BIND["Emit factory_bind"]:::process
    CRAFT_BUSY{"Native crafting queue busy?"}:::decision
    BG_WORK["With admitted background craft:<br/>plan only independent work permitted by job locks<br/>Otherwise retain a bounded observation wait"]:::process
    EMIT_WAIT["Emit factory_wait<br/>Observed effect and finite timeout"]:::process
    BOILER_LOW{"Existing boiler below its fuel threshold?"}:::decision
    GOAL_BRANCH{"Requested factory goal?"}:::decision
    NEED_IRON["Need 10 carried iron plates"]:::process
    NEED_SCIENCE["Need 10 carried automation science packs"]:::process
    NEED_LAB["Ensure lab, steam power and network<br/>Wait for powered-lab evidence"]:::process
    NEED_ROCKET_TECH["Ensure rocket-silo technology"]:::process
    NEED["Resolve an item and required quantity"]:::process
    HAVE{"Enough carried inventory?"}:::decision
    SATISFIED["Dependency satisfied<br/>Return to the calling prerequisite"]:::success
    OUTPUT{"Useful stock in an owned output?"}:::decision
    EMIT_EXTRACT["Emit receipt-bound factory_extract<br/>Rank feasible sources by useful pickup cost<br/>Unknown geometry keeps deterministic order"]:::process
    RAW{"Raw resource?"}:::decision
    RAW_EVIDENCE{"Observed resource and validated native site?<br/>Name, surface and finite position"}:::decision
    EMIT_EXPLORE["Emit bounded factory_explore<br/>Add 4 chunks while current radius is below 32<br/>Missing resource at the bound blocks"]:::process
    EMIT_GATHER["Emit factory_gather<br/>One mine for wood; at most 50 other raw units<br/>Failure identity binds site and inventory target"]:::process
    RECIPE["Resolve native recipe<br/>Reject cycles; at most 512 expansions"]:::process
    UNLOCKED{"Recipe unlocked?"}:::decision
    HAND{"Solid recipe is hand-craftable?"}:::decision
    INGREDIENTS["Recursively satisfy paid ingredients"]:::process
    EMIT_CRAFT["Emit factory_craft: at most 20 batches<br/>Background mode wraps supported recipes<br/>with a receipt-tracked craft job"]:::process
