subgraph JEV["5. Jev candidate judgment"]
    JEV_BATCH["Select from current feasible plans<br/>Ready-work: deduplicate and rank evidence<br/>Rebuild selection state each decision"]:::process
    MODEL_SKIP{"Deterministic policy, or hybrid ready-work<br/>with one distinct plan and healthy provider?"}:::decision
    MODEL_STATE["Facts, goal and last eight history events<br/>Include scheduling evidence when available<br/>Omit raw transfer receipts and connector lists"]:::evidence
    QUESTIONS["Offer up to 16 plans plus observe<br/>One choice and, for each plan:<br/>benefit 0–2, disruption 0–2,<br/>missing-start-evidence value 0–1"]:::process
    SIZE{"Serialized state + questions fit budget?<br/>Default: 32,000 UTF-8 bytes"}:::decision
    TRIM["Drop final candidate and rebuild<br/>Byte bound is not a token estimate"]:::process
    PROVIDER_GATE{"HTTP provider circuit admits a call?<br/>Cooldown, exhaustion and interrupted requests<br/>retain their durable incident budget"}:::decision
    API["Persist request reservation when configured<br/>Call client once for the entire batch<br/>HTTP clients use a 10-second timeout"]:::process
    API_RESULT{"Provider result?"}:::decision
    PROVIDER_HOLD["Record provider hold; keep observing<br/>No hybrid fallback or stall-budget charge<br/>No sleep inside provider evaluation"]:::caution
    PROVIDER_BUDGET["HTTP failure budgets: auth or quota: 3;<br/>network or rate limit: 8; schema: 1<br/>Interrupted healthy request exhausts at one<br/>Backoff and bounded Retry-After; persist budget"]:::evidence
    ANSWER_VALID{"Exact question keys and answer types?<br/>Finite values, complete distributions,<br/>matching rubrics and consistent choice/scores?<br/>Respect supported provider rounding"}:::decision
    GLOBAL_GATE{"Model chose observe<br/>or choice confidence below floor?<br/>Default floor: 0.45"}:::decision
    PER_PLAN["Exclude candidates needing evidence ≥ 0.5<br/>or benefit/disruption confidence below floor"]:::process
    UTILITY["Rank eligible offered plans:<br/>choice probability + benefit / 4<br/>− disruption / 8 − 0.02 per step<br/>A heuristic, not success probability"]:::process
    WINNER{"Any eligible candidate?"}:::decision
    JEV_CHOSEN["Select maximum-utility plan<br/>It can differ from the choice label"]:::success
    NO_DECISION["No usable model decision<br/>Retain reason and rejection diagnostics"]:::caution
    FALLBACK_POLICY{"Hybrid policy?"}:::decision
    FALLBACK["Ready-work: first available evidence-ranked plan<br/>Otherwise: fewest steps, then plan ID<br/>Uses feasible plans before model-byte pruning"]:::process
    STALL["Strict Jev: observe without mutation<br/>Increment stalled-decision count"]:::caution
    STALL_LIMIT{"Configured stall limit reached?<br/>Default: four decisions"}:::decision

    JEV_BATCH --> MODEL_SKIP
    MODEL_SKIP -->|Yes| FALLBACK
    MODEL_SKIP -->|No| MODEL_STATE --> QUESTIONS --> SIZE
    SIZE -->|No| TRIM
    TRIM -->|Candidates remain| QUESTIONS
    TRIM -->|None remain or invalid request| NO_DECISION
    SIZE -->|Yes| PROVIDER_GATE
    PROVIDER_GATE -->|Blocked| PROVIDER_HOLD
    PROVIDER_GATE -->|Admitted, or non-HTTP client| API --> API_RESULT
    API_RESULT -->|HTTP circuit records categorized failure| PROVIDER_HOLD
    PROVIDER_HOLD -. budget policy .-> PROVIDER_BUDGET
    PROVIDER_HOLD --> RECORD
    API_RESULT -->|Unwrapped transient failure or invalid payload| NO_DECISION
    API_RESULT -->|Unhandled error or persistence failure| GAME_ERROR
    API_RESULT -->|Answers received| ANSWER_VALID
    ANSWER_VALID -->|No| NO_DECISION
    ANSWER_VALID -->|Yes| GLOBAL_GATE
    GLOBAL_GATE -->|Yes| NO_DECISION
    GLOBAL_GATE -->|No| PER_PLAN --> UTILITY --> WINNER
    WINNER -->|Yes| JEV_CHOSEN --> COMMIT
    WINNER -->|No| NO_DECISION
    NO_DECISION --> FALLBACK_POLICY
    FALLBACK_POLICY -->|Yes| FALLBACK --> COMMIT
    FALLBACK_POLICY -->|No| STALL --> STALL_LIMIT
    STALL_LIMIT -->|Yes| BLOCKED
    STALL_LIMIT -->|No| RECORD
end

subgraph NATIVE["6. Native action execution"]
    ACTION_TYPE{"Committed native action type?<br/>One controller dispatch at a time"}:::decision
    NATIVE_GUARD["Validate command and endpoint-specific invariants<br/>Fair-action guard requires original connected actor,<br/>normal speed and no cheats"]:::process
    MOVE["Request native path and use walking_state<br/>Bounded safe detours; no obstacle destruction<br/>Blocked routes cool down"]:::process
    MINE_TARGET["Retain observed target and entity token<br/>Check cursor visibility and native reach<br/>Walk to approach only when needed"]:::process
    MINE["Set native mining_state and count real gain<br/>After depletion with progress, reacquire locally<br/>Mine only the remaining committed quantity"]:::process
    PLACE["Find buildable site and direction<br/>Walk only if outside native build reach<br/>Build from carried cursor item; verify debit"]:::process
    TRANSFER["Look up owned role; approach if needed<br/>Check reach, source and destination capacity<br/>Move paid items; write exact unit-bound receipt<br/>Partial quantity raises after receipt is stored"]:::process
    CONNECT_NATIVE["Discover compatible fluid ports or pole endpoints<br/>Bound route search and reject impossible preflight<br/>Place carried pipes or small electric poles"]:::process
    CRAFT_NATIVE["Queue unlocked native handcraft<br/>Require idle queue and directly supplied ingredients<br/>Receipt adapter tracks supported craft jobs"]:::process
    CONFIG_NATIVE["Approach machine; require unlocked recipe<br/>Refuse reconfiguration with buffered ingredients"]:::process
    RESEARCH_NATIVE["Start available research without canceling another<br/>Labs consume real science packs"]:::process
    LAUNCH_NATIVE["Prepare paid landing pad, payload or fish<br/>when requested by launch-readiness commands<br/>Approach ready silo and request native launch"]:::process
    COMPONENT_NATIVE["Optional adapters build one paid component:<br/>output chest/inserter; iron or copper outpost;<br/>bounded ore belt route or production site<br/>Receipt and native flow remain to be verified"]:::process
    SCOPE_NATIVE["Ore input routes are bounded iron/copper layouts<br/>No general coal-belt or downstream<br/>transport network is implemented here"]:::caution
    WAIT_NATIVE["Wait / idle returns without advancing game time<br/>Production and research continue in the engine"]:::process
    EXPLORE_NATIVE["Generate bounded normal map terrain<br/>No synthetic resource grants"]:::process
    BIND_NATIVE["Bind existing player and character<br/>Adapter attachment stops old controls<br/>Reject unreconciled legacy work"]:::process
    CONTROL_GUARD["Walking/mining polls fair.observe<br/>Each successful poll renews a 180-tick lease<br/>Sleep 0.1 seconds between RPCs<br/>Default wall-clock wait limit: 180 seconds"]:::process
    CONTROL_RESULT{"Native control result?"}:::decision
    CONTROL_STOP["Finally stop walking/mining controls<br/>Lease expiry, changed actor, stalled progress<br/>or timeout can leave compound action ambiguous"]:::caution
    NATIVE_RETURN["Adapter returned; success is not yet verified<br/>Legacy FLE act may return an error string<br/>Controller observes the required postcondition"]:::evidence
    NATIVE_ERROR["Factory adapter raised an error<br/>Controller distinguishes exact preflight rejection<br/>from a potentially partial mutation"]:::caution

    ACTION_TYPE --> NATIVE_GUARD
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Walk| MOVE --> CONTROL_GUARD
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Gather| MINE_TARGET --> MINE --> CONTROL_GUARD
    CONTROL_GUARD --> CONTROL_RESULT
    CONTROL_RESULT -->|Running and within time limit| CONTROL_GUARD
    CONTROL_RESULT -->|Completed| CONTROL_STOP
    CONTROL_RESULT -->|Failed or timed out| CONTROL_STOP
    CONTROL_STOP -->|Completed operation or legacy act error text| NATIVE_RETURN
    CONTROL_STOP -->|Factory call raised| NATIVE_ERROR
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Place| PLACE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Insert or extract| TRANSFER --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Connect| CONNECT_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Craft or craft job| CRAFT_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Configure| CONFIG_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Research| RESEARCH_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Launch or preparation| LAUNCH_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Buffer, outpost or input component| COMPONENT_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    COMPONENT_NATIVE -. capability boundary .-> SCOPE_NATIVE
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Wait or idle| WAIT_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Explore| EXPLORE_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Bind| BIND_NATIVE --> NATIVE_RETURN
    NATIVE_GUARD -->|Any endpoint raises| NATIVE_ERROR
end

subgraph VERIFY["7. Pending-action verification"]
    VERIFY_PENDING["Fresh observation before new planning<br/>Background extension also checks its retained job"]:::evidence
    VERIFY_BARRIER{"Execution barrier raised?<br/>For example: failed background evidence"}:::decision
    BG_PENDING_ADMIT{"Opt-in background work: unfinished single craft<br/>returned with fully accepted paid native receipt?<br/>Actor, queue, products and inventory match?"}:::decision
    BG_SAVE["Persist job and original attempt in background<br/>Release paid-input reservation; lock future outputs<br/>Preserve native-start deadline; clear foreground plan"]:::process
    BG_WATCH["Every later observation checks job identity,<br/>monotonic progress, deadline and earned output<br/>Persist before allowing independent work"]:::evidence
    BG_RESULT{"Background evidence?"}:::decision
    BG_DONE["Record verified completion; unlock outputs<br/>Clear background job and attempt; persist"]:::success
    BG_CONTINUE["Allow only independent gather, insert, extract<br/>or wait without touching locked products<br/>Use the same serial dispatcher"]:::process
    BG_YIELD{"Background extension: acknowledged craft-idle<br/>or research wait with independent ready work?"}:::decision
    RECOVERY_REF{"Explicit rejected-transfer recovery reference?"}:::decision
    RECOVERY_PROOF{"Exact historical and live evidence still match?<br/>Only the rejected 50-iron-ore furnace insertion;<br/>checkpoint, sealed log and source are bound"}:::decision
    PENDING_EFFECT{"Expected effect now observed?<br/>Use the action's exact postcondition"}:::decision
    RECEIPT_PARTIAL{"Original ambiguous native transfer has exact<br/>same-unit receipt for less than requested?<br/>Zero quantity also requires retained source"}:::decision
    PREPARED_SAFE{"Prepared original transfer: approach started/returned,<br/>transfer RPC never entered; no observation error,<br/>no receipt; same unit, source and reservation?<br/>Fresh preconditions and maintenance gate allow?"}:::decision
    RETAINED_DISPATCH["Persist recovery authorization and original phases<br/>Dispatch identical transfer with original attempt<br/>Persist returned state, then reobserve"]:::process
    RETAINED_RESULT{"Recovery outcome?"}:::decision
    RECOVERY_AMBIGUOUS["Retain original pending and attempt<br/>Mark dispatch ambiguous after backend error<br/>Do not replay an unproved transfer"]:::caution
    SAFE_RECONCILE{"Another exact no-replay predicate satisfied?"}:::decision
    ABSENCE["Ambiguous place: absent role and zero global count<br/>Ambiguous connection: zero connector count<br/>Both require retained reserved materials<br/>Prepared/ambiguous gather: after a prior poll,<br/>gain above baseline but below target"]:::evidence
    MAINTENANCE{"factory_wait with boiler coal below five?"}:::decision
    READY_YIELD{"Ready-work: acknowledged machine-output wait<br/>has an allowed, unsatisfied non-wait candidate?"}:::decision
    REPLAN_FUEL["Finish nonmutating wait; clear plan<br/>Replan maintenance or available useful work"]:::process
    POLLS["Increment original pending poll count"]:::process
    EXPIRED{"Step tick timeout or poll limit reached?<br/>Factory-enabled controllers use at least 1,800 polls"}:::decision
    NONMUTATING{"Action is idle or factory_wait?"}:::decision
    UNCERTAIN["Mark uncertain; retain unresolved evidence<br/>Preserve pending, attempt and reservations<br/>Require valid reconciliation before mutation"]:::stop
    WAIT_OBSERVE["Keep observing without redispatch<br/>Real game time advances naturally<br/>Only explicit mock mode dispatches idle for time"]:::process

    VERIFY_PENDING --> VERIFY_BARRIER
    VERIFY_BARRIER -->|Yes: retain state| RECORD
    VERIFY_BARRIER -->|No| BG_PENDING_ADMIT
    BG_PENDING_ADMIT -->|Yes| BG_SAVE --> RECORD
    BG_SAVE -. subsequent observations .-> BG_WATCH --> BG_RESULT
    BG_RESULT -->|Complete| BG_DONE
    BG_RESULT -->|Valid and still running| BG_CONTINUE
    BG_RESULT -->|Missing, changed, regressed or overdue| UNCERTAIN
    BG_PENDING_ADMIT -->|No or extension disabled| BG_YIELD
    BG_YIELD -->|Yes| REPLAN_FUEL
    BG_YIELD -->|No| RECOVERY_REF
    RECOVERY_REF -->|Present| RECOVERY_PROOF
    RECOVERY_PROOF -->|Proven zero durable effect| FAILPLAN
    RECOVERY_PROOF -->|Mismatch| UNCERTAIN
    RECOVERY_REF -->|Absent| PENDING_EFFECT
    PENDING_EFFECT -->|Yes| VERIFIED
    PENDING_EFFECT -->|No| RECEIPT_PARTIAL
    RECEIPT_PARTIAL -->|Yes: record exact quantity; replan| FAILPLAN
    RECEIPT_PARTIAL -->|No| PREPARED_SAFE
    PREPARED_SAFE -->|Yes| RETAINED_DISPATCH --> RETAINED_RESULT
    RETAINED_RESULT -->|Fresh postcondition verified| VERIFIED
    RETAINED_RESULT -->|Admission closed or still unverified| RECORD
    RETAINED_RESULT -->|Backend error| RECOVERY_AMBIGUOUS --> RECORD
    RETAINED_RESULT -->|Recorder failure| GAME_ERROR
    PREPARED_SAFE -->|No| SAFE_RECONCILE
    SAFE_RECONCILE -. exact predicates .-> ABSENCE
    SAFE_RECONCILE -->|Yes: replan without replay| FAILPLAN
    SAFE_RECONCILE -->|No| MAINTENANCE
    MAINTENANCE -->|Yes| REPLAN_FUEL --> RECORD
    MAINTENANCE -->|No| READY_YIELD
    READY_YIELD -->|Yes| REPLAN_FUEL
    READY_YIELD -->|No| POLLS --> EXPIRED
    EXPIRED -->|No| WAIT_OBSERVE --> RECORD
    EXPIRED -->|Yes| NONMUTATING
    NONMUTATING -->|Yes| FAILPLAN
    NONMUTATING -->|No| UNCERTAIN --> RECORD
end

subgraph REPAIR["8. Recovery classification and bounded source repair"]
    INCIDENT["Stop and reap owned gameplay process<br/>Classify latest checkpoint and matching exit evidence"]:::caution
    SOURCE_DEFECT{"Explicit source-defect evidence digest<br/>for this execution and session,<br/>with no pending/background ambiguity?"}:::decision
    OPERATOR_BLOCK["Block for operator reconciliation; exit 2<br/>Provider, quota, storage, native failure,<br/>uncertain outcome or unclassified exit<br/>Preserve pending actions and original cutoff"]:::stop
    REPAIR_BASELINE["Capture immutable incident checkpoint and source<br/>Reuse this baseline after rejection or restart"]:::evidence
    REPAIR_TIME{"Time remains before original cutoff<br/>and no stop request?"}:::decision
    REPAIR_BUDGET{"Incident repair budget available<br/>and repair account unblocked?"}:::decision
    CODEX["Persist attempt and audit identity<br/>Launch configured repair command with prompt<br/>Default attempt limit: 30 minutes, capped by cutoff"]:::process
    DIAGNOSE["Diagnose source, logs and available native evidence<br/>Preserve session, pending and fairness<br/>Repair agent must not launch gameplay"]:::process
    CHANGE_TYPE{"Code change needed?"}:::decision
    OPERATIONAL["Evidence-backed operational reconciliation<br/>Source identity and HEAD unchanged<br/>Pending and reservations remain for controller verification"]:::evidence
    IMPLEMENT["Implement focused fix and regression tests<br/>Run focused and full tests<br/>Keep normal walking, mining, reach and 1x speed"]:::process
    PUBLISH["Commit and push focused repair branch<br/>Open or update pull request"]:::process
    REVIEW["Independent review of exact PR head<br/>GitHub approval or separate-agent source artifact"]:::evidence
    CI{"Checks pass and exact-head review approves<br/>with no outstanding changes requested?"}:::decision
    MERGE["Merge without bypassing branch rules<br/>Synchronize clean local HEAD and origin/main<br/>Also synchronize fork/main if configured"]:::process
    RESULT["Write structured result with concrete evidence<br/>Code and operational claims have distinct requirements"]:::evidence
    ACCEPT["Supervisor validates checkpoint and report<br/>Preserve pending, attempt, plans, reservations,<br/>background commitments, outcomes and failure budgets"]:::process
    ACCEPT_CODE["For code: independently verify merged PR, review,<br/>checks, exact commit, clean tree and remote main tips<br/>Run full pytest or validate exact prevalidation artifact"]:::evidence
    ACCEPT_PROOF["Recheck unchanged result bytes and source revision<br/>Record source segment and durable acceptance event"]:::evidence
    ACCEPTED{"Repair accepted and audit durable?"}:::decision
    RETRY["Keep gameplay stopped; record rejected attempt<br/>Exponential backoff capped at 15 minutes<br/>Default budget: 3 attempts per incident"]:::caution
    QUOTA{"Repair account quota exhausted<br/>or incident attempt budget spent?"}:::decision
    READY["Clear accepted repair-required gate<br/>Keep original world, checkpoint and cutoff<br/>Only supervisor may resume gameplay"]:::success

    INCIDENT --> SOURCE_DEFECT
    SOURCE_DEFECT -->|No| OPERATOR_BLOCK
    SOURCE_DEFECT -->|Yes| REPAIR_BASELINE --> REPAIR_TIME
    REPAIR_TIME -->|No| STOP
    REPAIR_TIME -->|Yes| REPAIR_BUDGET
    REPAIR_BUDGET -->|No| OPERATOR_BLOCK
    REPAIR_BUDGET -->|Yes| CODEX
    CODEX --> DIAGNOSE --> CHANGE_TYPE
    CHANGE_TYPE -->|No| OPERATIONAL --> RESULT
    CHANGE_TYPE -->|Yes| IMPLEMENT --> PUBLISH --> REVIEW --> CI
    CI -->|No| IMPLEMENT
    CI -->|Yes| MERGE --> RESULT
    RESULT -->|Repair process exits successfully| ACCEPT
    ACCEPT -->|Code claim| ACCEPT_CODE
    ACCEPT_CODE -->|Verified| ACCEPT_PROOF
    ACCEPT_CODE -->|Rejected| QUOTA
    ACCEPT -->|Operational claim and unchanged source| ACCEPT_PROOF
    ACCEPT -->|Invalid claim or changed protected state| QUOTA
    ACCEPT_PROOF --> ACCEPTED
    CODEX -->|Timeout, failure or quota limit| QUOTA
    ACCEPTED -->|No| QUOTA
    QUOTA -->|Yes| OPERATOR_BLOCK
    QUOTA -->|No| RETRY --> REPAIR_TIME
    ACCEPTED -->|Yes| READY --> DEADLINE
end

